OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain, heavy
OL,6,Fat times, will clear from the
OL,7,Fsouthwest this evening. Then the rest
OL,8,Fof the night will see clear periods
OL,9,Fand the odd passing shower. Strong
OL,10,Fwinds easing down.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FChance of a few showers at
OL,13,Ffirst otherwise it will be mainly dry
OL,14,Fwith some sunny intervals.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,17,Fon Tuesday with strong southeasterly
OL,18,Fwinds, gales later. Windy with rain
OL,19,Fspreading northeast on Wednesday. Dry
OL,20,Fand bright on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
